│ personallog.ai  →  127.0.0.1:8000  (PersonalLog backend)   │
│ fishinglog.ai   →  127.0.0.1:8001  (FishingLog backend)    │
│ dmlog.ai        →  127.0.0.1:8002  (DMLog backend)         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

🔒 SSL Configuration:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Certificate: /etc/ssl/certs/nginx-selfsigned.crt           │
│ Private Key: /etc/ssl/private/nginx-selfsigned.key         │
│ Protocols:   TLSv1.2, TLSv1.3                              │
