2. Ensure backend services are running on their designated ports:
   - PersonalLog on port 8000
   - FishingLog on port 8001  
   - DMLog on port 8002
3. Wait for DNS propagation (can take up to 48 hours)
4. Test HTTPS access to all domains (browsers will warn about self-signed cert)

🔧 Management Commands:
   Check nginx status:  ssh -i '$EC2_KEY' '$EC2_HOST' 'sudo systemctl status nginx'
   Reload nginx:        ssh -i '$EC2_KEY' '$EC2_HOST' 'sudo systemctl reload nginx'
   Test config:         ssh -i '$EC2_KEY' '$EC2_HOST' 'sudo nginx -t'
   View logs:           ssh -i '$EC2_KEY' '$EC2_HOST' 'sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/*.log'

